        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "Very weak coffee, more like warm water.  Moka was filter coffee with some kind of mixture, no expresso shot.  Tasted like warm diluted chocolate milk.\nPastries are better but don’t come here for a coffee.",
        "time": 1761585816,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Katiana Jb",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110011620772458909987/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVSymHX3gnPsneW1gjACwD0mF8FaHjV6LNdxTqTsPGsFGgC1x5n=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "Warm place ! The owner is so sweet and welcoming. The shop is really cute and offers good quality pastries, sandwiches, salads etc. Best find in town ! 🥰✨💫",
        "time": 1760657477,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "George Rampersaud",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109336174362795517334/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVDsZWHb-i8_13lX9WqD3TO9z-PRhJUTvw31ufz_V0Mfw3Zx3u7=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Tiramisu is 5/5!!\nIt had too much cocoa powder (some may like it), but once you take that layer off, the cake is amazing!\n\nNo reason to lose any stars for that.\n\nChocolatine are great too!\n\nThanks again!",
        "time": 1678636013,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Julia Boland",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105154322888110878586/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJxaFdWpLfYSZ4E0hvPWlhK0RXhj0rgWWUmlE1oyfX3HJQKDQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Such a lovely little bakery/café! Everything is always fresh and you are always greeted with warm, friendly smiles! Customer service is amazing and the coffee is delicious. Can’t recommend this place enough and so nice to support a local place!",
        "time": 1737567359,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Kristen Roberts",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104754591313882839875/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIg99VtkRTlpowW9EsNuX7lXxQstBLAqRxjY3c6Fb_rUSfn7A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 2,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "My husband picked up some millefeuilles to surprise me as they are my favorite. The icing was hard as a rock and tasteless. The pastry layers were dry and lacked anything close to what they should. On-top of it all each pastry was $$$. Which wouldn't be a big deal but when it's of such poor quality it's extremely dishonest to sell that as fresh or even call it millefeuilles. Just disappointed at this . Never buying from them again. Will support other local bakeries instead",
        "time": 1737161296,
        "translated": false
      }
